{\fs22\b SpaceSharp is installed}\par\par
You'll find SpaceSharp in the Start menu.\par\par
{\b Getting started}\par
\li360\fi-360 1.  Pick a drive and click {\b Scan drive}, or click {\b Scan folder} to look at one folder.\par\li0\fi0
\li360\fi-360 2.  The biggest boxes are the biggest space users. Hover for details, double-click to zoom in.\par\li0\fi0
\li360\fi-360 3.  Right-click a box to open it, show it in Explorer, or move it to the Recycle Bin.\par\li0\fi0
\par\par
The gear button (or {\b Ctrl+,}) opens the settings. {\b F1} opens About, with the full list of keyboard shortcuts.\par\par
Free and open source under the MIT license. Feedback and ideas are welcome at github.com/ClearanceClarence/SpaceSharp.\par\par
